description: TypeScript and React conventions for Photokin
globs: src/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# TypeScript / React

- Match local style. Named functional components. No drive-by refactors.
- UI controls: reuse `src/components/ui/` before new primitives.
- DB lists: `useLiveQuery` + services. Don’t add `useEffect` fetch loops.
- Writes: `executeInDB` so table observables invalidate.
- Native OS/image work: TS wrapper around `invoke`, not pixel buffers in JS.
- Routes: `AppRoutes` in `router.tsx`. Zustand for session/UI state.
